[
  {
    "slug": "feature_execution_trace",
    "name": "运行路径：节点与连线高亮",
    "group": "features",
    "graph": {
      "name": "运行路径示例",
      "description": "常量 → Python 逻辑 → 输出",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "score",
          "type": "Constant",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 160,
          "title": "成绩数据",
          "config": {
            "value": {
              "score": 88
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "grade",
          "type": "Python",
          "x": 410,
          "y": 160,
          "title": "计算等级",
          "config": {
            "code": "score = value[\"score\"]\nresult = {\"passed\": score >= 60, \"grade\": \"A\" if score >= 85 else \"B\"}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "output",
          "type": "Output",
          "x": 780,
          "y": 160,
          "title": "输出结果",
          "config": {
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "edges": [
        {
          "source": "score",
          "out": "value",
          "target": "grade",
          "in": "value"
        },
        {
          "source": "grade",
          "out": "value",
          "target": "output",
          "in": "value"
        }
      ]
    },
    "expected": {
      "score": {
        "value": {
          "score": 88
        }
      },
      "grade": {
        "value": {
          "passed": true,
          "grade": "A"
        }
      },
      "output": {
        "value": {
          "passed": true,
          "grade": "A"
        }
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "action": "start",
        "text": "这一节演示运行路径高亮。画布现在完全为空，没有节点，也没有连线。我们从零搭建一个成绩判断流程。"
      },
      {
        "action": "node",
        "node": {
          "id": "score",
          "type": "Constant",
          "x": 60,
          "y": 160,
          "title": "成绩数据",
          "config": {
            "value": {
              "score": 88
            }
          }
        },
        "text": "先添加 Constant 节点，输入包含成绩八十八分的结构化数据。"
      },
      {
        "action": "node",
        "node": {
          "id": "grade",
          "type": "Python",
          "x": 410,
          "y": 160,
          "title": "计算等级",
          "config": {
            "code": "score = value[\"score\"]\nresult = {\"passed\": score >= 60, \"grade\": \"A\" if score >= 85 else \"B\"}"
          }
        },
        "text": "添加 Python 节点，把及格判断和等级规则收在一处，避免把复杂逻辑拆成碎节点。"
      },
      {
        "action": "edge",
        "edge": {
          "source": "score",
          "out": "value",
          "target": "grade",
          "in": "value"
        },
        "text": "连接成绩数据到 Python 节点的 value 输入端口。数据流只负责传递数据。"
      },
      {
        "action": "node",
        "node": {
          "id": "output",
          "type": "Output",
          "x": 780,
          "y": 160,
          "title": "输出结果",
          "config": {
            "value": ""
          }
        },
        "text": "添加 Output 节点，用于展示工作流的最终结果。"
      },
      {
        "action": "edge",
        "edge": {
          "source": "grade",
          "out": "value",
          "target": "output",
          "in": "value"
        },
        "text": "连接计算等级的输出到结果节点，完整数据路径已经清晰可见。"
      },
      {
        "action": "run",
        "text": "运行工作流。界面会根据真实执行轨迹依次高亮节点和经过的连线。"
      },
      {
        "action": "result",
        "text": "结果显示 passed 为 true，grade 为 A。高亮回放让当前执行到了哪里一目了然。"
      }
    ]
  },
